## Revenue Mix

Software Solutions remains the largest and highest-margin segment,
contributing 60% of total revenue in the quarter. Professional Services grew
28% year over year and now represents just over a quarter of the business,
while Support & Maintenance continues to provide a stable, recurring
foundation underneath both.

